    <releaseNotes> v16.1 RELEASE (Build 3200) - 2026-07-24
  ADDED - Commandline field command "cd path1|path2" to change both panel at the same time. Usefull when Alias shhould change both panels.
  ADDED - MultiScript Method  SetAppCaptionTag() to change Tag in Application title bar
  FIXED - Content Copy plugin did not always changge the target path to correct path.
  FIXED - Preparing for Move opertion did not show an items count that incremented when items was added to queue.
  FIXED - Drop of files that was sending data using newer AsyncDrop operation. like New Outlook.
  FIXED - Improved error logging in file operations.
  FIXED - 5+ Stability issues</releaseNotes>
